# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Saída escrever: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), stop.
Saída escrever: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), stop.
Saída escrever: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), stop.
Saída escrever: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), stop.
Saída escrever: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), stop.
Saída escrever: ([''] tccompare: ['']), stop.
